{
  "uid": "kinowo-code-quality",
  "title": "Code quality \u2014 the ratchets",
  "tags": [
    "ci",
    "quality"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "description": "Every language's frozen ratchet rows over time -- Scala, Python, JS/TS, the design rules, the shell-to-Python migration, agentctl -- read from the baselines each main commit commits (scripts/ci/quality_metrics.py).",
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": false,
        "iconColor": "purple",
        "name": "Deploys",
        "tags": [
          "deploy"
        ],
        "type": "tags"
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Baselines",
      "type": "link",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "url": "https://github.com/pawelkrupinski/movies/tree/main/test/resources"
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "repo",
        "label": "Repo",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "local-prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(kinowo_quality_rows, repo)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(kinowo_quality_rows, repo)",
          "refId": "repo"
        },
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all",
          "selected": true
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 0,
        "description": "movies, or agentctl (~/bin, its own repository).",
        "regex": ""
      },
      {
        "name": "language",
        "label": "Language",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "local-prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(kinowo_quality_rows{repo=~\"$repo\"}, language)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(kinowo_quality_rows{repo=~\"$repo\"}, language)",
          "refId": "language"
        },
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all",
          "selected": true
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 0,
        "description": "scala, py (the Python tools), js (the production JS/TS); one quality row each.",
        "regex": "/^(scala|py|js)$/"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Every ratchet baseline main COMMITS, read back after each Main run (`scripts/ci/quality_metrics.py`, from `report-timings.yml`): nothing is re-measured. **Rows** = the frozen rows past a limit (a method, file, clone set, package or module each); **sum** = their values added up (lines, errors, fan-out). Families: **quality** (the complexity / length / duplication / coupling / pyright / mypy ratchets), **design** (the general rule core, `design-baseline.tsv`), **migration** (the shell-to-Python MIGRATE list), **ceilings** (agentctl's `ctx` and locator ceilings). The ratchets only let a row fall, so every line here should step DOWN."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Now, and falling?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Frozen quality rows now",
      "description": "The quality family's frozen rows per repo and language at the latest commit read (complexity, length, clones, coupling, pyright / mypy files). Falls as the work list is cleared.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "local-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "interval": "1h",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "local-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (repo, language) (last_over_time(kinowo_quality_rows{repo=~\"$repo\", language=~\"$language\", family=\"quality\"}[30d]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{repo}} {{language}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Frozen design-rule rows now",
      "description": "The design family's frozen rows per repo and language: naming, effects, state, import-time IO, fan-out, distance, layers, directory cycles.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "local-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "interval": "1h",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "local-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (repo, language) (last_over_time(kinowo_quality_rows{repo=~\"$repo\", language=~\"$language\", family=\"design\"}[30d]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{repo}} {{language}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Falling? Rows now, and their change over 7 and 30 days",
      "description": "Each measure's frozen rows now, and now minus 7 / 30 days ago: negative is the ratchet doing its job, positive a row added with its trailer. A change is blank where the series is younger than the offset (the backfill reaches 2026-10-27).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "local-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      },
      "interval": "1h",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "local-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (repo, language, family, measure) (last_over_time(kinowo_quality_rows{repo=~\"$repo\", language=~\"$language\", family=~\"quality|design|ceilings\"}[30d]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "now",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "local-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (repo, language, family, measure) (last_over_time(kinowo_quality_rows{repo=~\"$repo\", language=~\"$language\", family=~\"quality|design|ceilings\"}[30d])) - sum by (repo, language, family, measure) (last_over_time(kinowo_quality_rows{repo=~\"$repo\", language=~\"$language\", family=~\"quality|design|ceilings\"}[30d] offset 7d))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "7d",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "local-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (repo, language, family, measure) (last_over_time(kinowo_quality_rows{repo=~\"$repo\", language=~\"$language\", family=~\"quality|design|ceilings\"}[30d])) - sum by (repo, language, family, measure) (last_over_time(kinowo_quality_rows{repo=~\"$repo\", language=~\"$language\", family=~\"quality|design|ceilings\"}[30d] offset 30d))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "30d",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value #now": "rows now",
              "Value #7d": "change 7d",
              "Value #30d": "change 30d"
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "repo": 0,
              "language": 1,
              "family": 2,
              "measure": 3,
              "Value #now": 4,
              "Value #7d": 5,
              "Value #30d": 6
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "rows now",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "change.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "text",
                      "value": 0
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "red",
                      "value": 0.5
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "$language: the quality ratchets",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "repeat": "language"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Frozen rows by measure",
      "description": "Each measure's rows past its limit (complexity, length, clones, cycles, fan-out, distance, the data guard, pyright / mypy files), per repo. A held measure with no row draws 0.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "local-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "interval": "1h",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "local-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (repo, measure) (last_over_time(kinowo_quality_rows{repo=~\"$repo\", language=\"$language\", family=\"quality\"}[7d]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{repo}} {{measure}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "sortBy": "Last *",
          "sortDesc": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Their values, summed by measure",
      "description": "The same rows' values added up: the total cognitive / cyclomatic complexity of the frozen methods, their lines, the clone copies, the fan-out, the strict pyright / mypy errors.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "local-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "interval": "1h",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "local-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (repo, measure) (last_over_time(kinowo_quality_sum{repo=~\"$repo\", language=\"$language\", family=\"quality\"}[7d]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{repo}} {{measure}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
