      "title": "Design rules: the other kinds",
      "description": "The design family's other rows: suffix and abbreviation names, module state, import-time IO, fan-out, the data guard, distance, layer edges, directory cycles (and `mixed` once it lands).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
